Subject: [PATCH v5 22/25] xfs: check and repair the verity inode flag state
Date: Thu, 19 Mar 2026 18:02:09 +0100
Message-ID: <20260319170231.1455553-23-aalbersh@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.51.2
In-Reply-To: <20260319170231.1455553-1-aalbersh@kernel.org>
